[{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0575","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0575.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0745","title":"PHP-Nuke 内容管理系统未授权访问权限提升漏洞","description":"PHP-Nuke 1.0 和 2.5 版本中的 admin.php3 脚本在处理管理员身份验证时存在缺陷，未能正确验证管理员密码。远程攻击者可以通过请求一个不包含 aid 或 pwd 参数的特定 URL，绕过身份验证机制，直接获取管理员特权。该漏洞允许攻击者在无需凭据的情况下完全控制受影响的网站，导致敏感信息泄露及系统被非法篡改。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0745"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"建议立即将 PHP-Nuke 升级至 2.6 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，应在 `admin.php3` 中增加严格的参数校验逻辑，确保在 `aid` 和 `pwd` 参数缺失时强制跳转至登录页面，或在 Web 服务器层面限制对管理后台的访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0243.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1521","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1592","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20158","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0745","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/ba3a5a16133dacbe91f9caa1bbe5a2b5e83a86a7/2000/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0745.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0745.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0745.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0575.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0575.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0575.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0572","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0572.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0743","title":"University of Minnesota Gopherd 2.x 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"明尼苏达大学 (UMN) Gopherd 2.x 版本中的 Halidate 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。漏洞原理是程序在处理 DES 密钥生成请求 (GDESkey) 时，未能对输入的 ticket 字段进行有效的长度检查，导致特制的数据可以覆盖内存缓冲区。远程未经身份验证的攻击者可通过向目标 Gopher 服务发送包含超长 ticket 值的恶意请求，触发该溢出漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码或命令。该漏洞影响所有使用 Gopherd 2.x 的系统，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0743"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"由于 UMN Gopherd 2.x 为极旧的过时软件且已停止维护，建议立即停止运行该服务并将其替换为安全的现代替代方案（如 HTTPS 站点）。若必须保留，请在防火墙中禁用 Gopher 默认端口（70）以阻断远程攻击路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0112.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1569","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20157","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0743","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/10e9467be38429ca2d719aefc6850e69115854fd/2000/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0743.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0743.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0743.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0572.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0571","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0571.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0741","title":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 格式字符串远程代码执行漏洞","description":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 的 strong.exe 程序中存在格式字符串漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送一个包含特制格式字符串且后缀为 .XUDA 的 URL 请求，触发程序在处理请求时的解析缺陷。该漏洞允许未经身份验证的攻击者在远程服务器上执行任意代码，导致系统完全被接管。此漏洞影响 HotFix 3 之前的所有 1.0 版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0741"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"建议立即安装 NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 的 HotFix 3 补丁。若无法立即升级，建议在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面拦截所有包含 .XUDA 扩展名的请求，以防止远程攻击者利用格式字符串漏洞执行任意代码。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0473.html","http://download.nai.com/products/licensed/pgp/hf3pki10.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1490","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1538","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20136","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0741","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/2d3362e5d3b95223fab83ca531e4c3b2a7ca274a/2000/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0741.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/1b01d01b655cac08088621898fd70278524e2f0e/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0741.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0741.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0571.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0571.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0571.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0570","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0570.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0740","title":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 strong.exe 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 的 strong.exe 程序在处理 HTTPS 端口请求时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可以通过在 HTTPS 请求中发送一个超长的 URL 触发该漏洞，导致程序崩溃或执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 HotFix 3 之前的 1.0 版本，攻击条件为目标系统开放 HTTPS 服务且可被远程访问，利用方式为构造特定长度的恶意 URL 载荷，从而实现对目标服务器的远程代码执行。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0740"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:23Z","remediation":"建议将 NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0 升级至 HotFix 3 或更高版本，以修复 strong.exe 在处理 HTTPS 请求时的缓冲区溢出漏洞。如无法立即升级，建议在网络防火墙上限制对该服务 HTTPS 端口的访问，或使用 Web 应用防火墙 (WAF) 拦截超长 URL 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0473.html","http://download.nai.com/products/licensed/pgp/hf3pki10.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1488","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1536","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5026","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20134","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0740","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/8f9388ccf03511af7a94793190933c2b79f3688a/2000/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0740.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0740.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-0740.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0570.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0570.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0570.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0569","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0569.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0739","title":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"NAI Net Tools PKI Server 1.0（HotFix 3 之前版本）中的 strong.exe 程序存在目录遍历漏洞。远程攻击者可以通过向注册服务器发送包含 \"..\"（点点）序列的特制 HTTPS 请求，绕过路径限制，从而非法读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞允许未经身份验证的攻击者获取系统敏感信息，影响范围为所有未安装相应补丁的 1.0 版本实例。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0739"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"建议立即将 NAI Net Tools PKI server 升级到 HotFix 3 或更高版本。若无法立即升级，建议在 Web 服务器或防火墙层面配置过滤规则，拦截包含 \"..\" 等路径遍历特征的 HTTPS 请求，以缓解非法文件读取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0473.html","http://download.nai.com/products/licensed/pgp/hf3pki10.txt","http://www.osvdb.org/1489","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1537","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5066","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20135","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/33ec434954e61bc39d0dce97d60b798545efd141/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/39cf4547de2e266ceb8827aa7ae993ba929a25b6/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0739","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/6b33754436807963644c2d5992bc8ca82f7c9f07/2000/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/63bc6ccb7d9e7d0447e23eb842c0b23beddd261c/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0739.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/04ded07645d3d1d1ff4bc7fdbd85d7a922796dcd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0739.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1811750a5b6a37290aff484954f5ab77b0ca64a7/content/CVE-2000-0739.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0569.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0568","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0568.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0737","title":"微软 Windows Server 2000 命名管道可预测性漏洞","description":"Windows Server 2000的Service Control Manager (SCM)服务在创建命名管道时使用可预测的名称，使得本地用户能够通过控制台访问时跟踪并识别这些管道。通过模仿合法管道的身份验证过程，攻击者可以建立管道连接并欺骗系统授权执行管理员级别的操作。这使得攻击者能够从普通用户权限提升到系统管理员权限，从而获得对整个系统的完全控制权。攻击条件要求攻击者首先获得目标系统的本地访问权限（如控制台访问）并了解管道的命名模式。利用方式通常涉及调用CreateNamedPipe函数时提供的可预测名称，随后通过呼叫特定Win32 API实现管道劫持。微软在2000年10月的安全更新中修复了这一漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0737"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"升级到 Windows Server 2000 SP2或更高版本（如SP3/SP4），并应用相关安全更新包；禁用或重新配置可疑的命名前置服务；使用网络安全策略限制本地用户Console权限；若无法立即升级，可在防火墙中阻止对特定服务控制管理器命名管道的访问，并使用严格的访问控制列表限制本地用户权限","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1535","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/2000/ms00-053","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20133","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b3c35d89abde60a88f7cb8e626161de34dd6ab36/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bcbdb8ae7a9ef1c1e1ea2320e0a3f339a967446e/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0737","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/fa386d759f2a771540ca69b5fc06cb6091dcd950/2000/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/8a3e2d14c2e04b1bff1df5344192e8356dcd6b1d/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0737.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0737.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0737.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0568.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0566","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0566.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0734","title":"eEye Digital Security IRIS 1.01 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"eEye Digital Security IRIS 1.01 beta 版本存在 UDP 连接拒绝服务漏洞，攻击者可通过发送大量 UDP 连接请求耗尽系统资源，导致服务拒绝。该漏洞影响 IRIS 1.01 beta 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属于网络可利用、低攻击复杂度、无需认证的可用性影响漏洞。远程未授权攻击者可通过发送大量 UDP 连接请求耗尽目标系统资源，导致拒绝服务。ExploitDB 记录显示 IRIS 1.0.1 及 SpyNet CaptureNet 3.0.12 还存在远程缓冲区溢出漏洞，可能允许远程代码执行。建议升级至修复版本或限制 UDP 连接数量缓解风险。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0734"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"立即升级到 BeyondTrust Privileged Remote Access (PRA) 3.0 或更高版本，替代已过时的eEye IRIS产品服务；如无法立即升级，可在防火墙上添加UDP 135/137/138端口访问控制列表ACL限制，并严格限制源IP数量以缓解大流量UDP洪水攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=96774637326591&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1627","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20184","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4a364075e0f1d18be5590f7700d143d985f1789f/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0734","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/cf9f26fab3bbc76af663e922f8ccf4da465b1866/2000/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1b97942de7f8736fb9dac77c314951b8b2cd2867/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0734.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0734.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0734.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0566.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0564","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0564.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0733","title":"Silicon Graphics IRIX TelnetD 格式字符串漏洞","description":"SGI IRIX 操作系统的 Telnet 守护进程 (telnetd) 存在格式字符串漏洞，影响 IRIX 5.2 至 6.1 版本。漏洞原理是 telnetd 在处理 IAC-SB-TELOPT_ENVIRON 请求时，未对用户注入的 RLD 环境变量进行格式字符串清理，导致攻击者可构造恶意格式字符串实现任意代码执行。攻击条件为远程未授权，攻击者仅需向目标发送包含超长 RLD 变量的特制 Telnet 协议数据包即可触发。CVSS 评分 10.0 (AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C)，危害等级为严重，可导致系统完全沦陷。ExploitDB 已公开利用代码 (EDB-ID: 20149)。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0733"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:22Z","remediation":"立即升级到最新的IRIX 6.x补丁包（建议>=6.5），关闭不必要的telnet服务，或通过修改telnet服务器源代码修复格式字符串处理漏洞，避免在IAC-SB-TELOPT_ENVIRON请求中使用用户控制的RLD变量。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0154.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1572","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20149","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-200