0114.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1586","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20155","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfb6e225b1c4cf2b8d9aae867cd6425d269deaa5/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a14b63e8afc2a58338f509c08078b69c0cfe7fee/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0721","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/89eeaa8d7ef6ae24cbc356832e183d8519afcdb0/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1f3ca0e00ad5dad93605113d84cef4bc28a81b05/2000/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/beba1b176cd5b7fd45b0085792055fbb0538d4d6/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0721.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0721.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0721.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0562.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0562.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0562.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0561","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0561.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0720","title":"GWScripts News Publisher 未授权添加作者漏洞","description":"tags.<value>GWScripts News Publisher 1.0 的 news.cgi 存在认证绕过漏洞，程序在处理 addAuthor 参数添加作者时未进行有效的身份验证，仅通过检查 HTTP Referer 头是否指向 news.cgi 来判断请求合法性。远程攻击者可构造 POST 请求，将 Referer 设置为 news.cgi 的 URL，从而绕过认证机制，向作者索引文件（author.file）中写入任意用户名和密码的新作者账户。该漏洞影响 GWScripts News Publisher 1.0 及之前版本，攻击无需任何身份认证即可利用，CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0720"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:20Z","remediation":"升级 GWScripts News Publisher 至已修复版本；在服务器端禁用对 Referer 头的认证依赖，为 news.cgi 的 addAuthor 接口部署独立的访问控制列表（ACL）并限制来源 IP，同时为作者管理功能添加独立的用户身份验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1621","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=003301c0123b%2418f8c1a0%24953b29d4%40e8s9s4","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5169","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20183","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ee7574df80bfcc012868b69b66762b8e0d540545/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3ed8c658b6417422ff741957485ec0a908b97173/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0720","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/747b61179236bdbb4e6f99f673449b4411456380/2000/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/b9bdbe1f3e86c735cfb0385ee07d9456b7225b20/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0720.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/4cd7841d39f8c59056b450c5339511feb54f9bc6/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0720.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0720.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0561.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0561.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0561.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0559","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0559.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0711","title":"Sun JDK 1.1.x / Netscape Communicator 侦听套件漏洞","description":"Netscape Communicator 未能正确阻止不受信任的实体创建 ServerSocket 对象，导致远程攻击者可通过恶意 Applet 在受害者系统上创建监听服务器，如 Brown Orifice Applet 所演示。该漏洞影响 Sun JDK 1.1.x、Sun JRE 1.1.x 及 Netscape Communicator，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过网络发起攻击，攻击复杂度低，成功利用可导致受害系统机密性、完整性、可用性均受到部分影响（CVSS 7.5，高危）。攻击者通过诱导用户运行恶意 Applet，在受害机器上建立监听端口，进而实现远程访问或进一步攻击。Sun 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至 JDK/JRE 1.2 或更高版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0711"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:19Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Sun JDK/JRE 1.2 或更高版本（已修复 ServerSocket 权限校验缺陷）。若无法立即升级，请在浏览器中彻底禁用 Java Applet 支持（Netscape Communicator 取消“启用 Java”勾选），并在防火墙层面禁止非受信任端口监听，作为临时缓解措施。建议尽快迁移至 JDK 1.2.2_001 或更高版本彻底修复该漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-2000-15.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1545","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=20000805020429.11774.qmail%40securityfocus.com","http://www.securityfocus.com/templates/archive.pike?list=1&msg=3999922128E.EE84TAKAGI%40java-house.etl.go.jp","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20139","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f54d76ab772484c9516adea70c89afaeb5255051/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0711","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/205083faf6b3f186002bb501f7178bdd84048b96/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0711.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b4e8e071ec72e458e6fba462e799cbd376c49627/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0711.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2000-0711.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0559.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0556","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0556.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0706","title":"Luca Deri ntop 1.2 a7-9/1.3.1 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Luca Deri ntop 1.2 a7-9 及 1.3.1 版本在 Web 模式下运行时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程未认证攻击者可通过向 Web 服务发送特制恶意数据触发缓冲区溢出，进而在目标系统上以 ntop 进程权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 ntop 1.2 a7-9 及 1.3.1 版本的 Web 管理界面，CVSS 评分 10.0（CVSS:3.0/AV:N/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:U/C:H/I:H/A:H），属于严重级别远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用，攻击复杂度低，可完全破坏系统机密性、完整性和可用性。攻击者可利用公开的 Exploit（如 ExploitDB-20150）发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求触发缓冲区溢出，获取服务器控制权。建议升级至修复版本或禁用 Web 管理模式。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0706"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18Z","remediation":"立即将 ntop 升级至支持版本 3.x 或以上，切换使用现代的 ntopng 监控工具，旧版 ntop  vulnerabilities 已废弃，建议直接迁移或更新至 ≥2020 版以获取完整的安全补丁","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2000/20000830","http://www.osvdb.org/1513","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1576","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20150","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0706","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0706.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0706.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0706.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2000/POC-AVE-2000-0556.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2000/EXP-AVE-2000-0556.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0556.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0554","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0554.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0705","title":"Luca Deri ntop 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Luca Deri ntop 1.2 a7-9 Web 模式存在目录遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 \"..\"（点点）序列的 HTTP 请求，突破 Web 根目录限制读取服务器文件系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响 ntop 1.2 a7 至 a9 版本的 Web 管理模式，攻击者无需认证即可通过网络远程利用，仅需发送包含目录遍历序列的 HTTP 请求即可读取敏感文件（如密码文件、配置文件等），CVSS 评分 5.0（中等危害），机密性影响为部分，无完整性和可用性影响。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0705"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18Z","remediation":"升级 ntop 至 1.2 a10 或更高版本（含 Red Hat RHSA-2000:049 修复补丁），或禁用 ntop Web 管理模式；若暂时无法升级，请在 Web 服务器层面配置路径规范化与访问控制，拦截包含 \"..\" 目录遍历序列的 HTTP 请求，并限制 Web 进程对敏感目录（/etc、/var 等）的读取权限。参考 Red Hat 安全公告：http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-049.html","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-07/0459.html","http://www.osvdb.org/1496","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2000-049.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1550","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20143","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/fc5c3e6f60accc24b7eac4fd31472f0e5fd97f24/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0705","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0705.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0705.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0705.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0554.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0553","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0704","title":"SGI Omron WorldView Wnn 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"` tags and other content got mixed into the TOML itself.\n\nLet me construct a proper description based on the NVD data:\n\nNVD description: \"Buffer overflow in SGI Omron WorldView Wnn allows remote attackers to execute arbitrary commands via long JS_OPEN, JS_MKDIR, or JS_FILE_INFO commands.\"\n\nLocal data:\n- AVD title: \"WorldView 6.5/Wnn4 4.2 - Asian Language Server 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞\"\n- ExploitDB title: \"WorldView 6.5/Wnn4 4.2 - Asian Language Server Remote Buffer Overflow\"\n- CVSS 10, AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:C/I:C/A:C\n\nI need to write a proper Chinese description that:\n- Explains the buffer overflow principle\n- Mentions affected products (SGI Omron WorldView Wnn / WorldView 6.5/Wnn4 4.2)\n- Mentions attack conditions (remote, no authentication needed)\n- Is ≥50 characters\n\nLet me write the description and put it in <value> tags.<value>SGI Omron WorldView Wnn 存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的长 JS_OPEN、JS_MKDIR 或 JS_FILE_INFO 命令字符串触发溢出，从而执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 WorldView 6.5/Wnn4 4.2 Asian Language Server 系统，允许未经身份认证的远程攻击者直接利用，无需任何权限即可触发。漏洞利用后可导致机密性、完整性和可用性同时丧失，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级极为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0704"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18Z","remediation":"升级到 WorldView 6.8 或更高版本，修复 JS_OPEN、JS_MKDIR 和 JS_FILE_INFO 命令的边界检查漏洞。如无法立即升级，可通过防火墙限制对 Asian Language Server 的访问，禁用这些特定命令的网络访问通道。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.osvdb.org/11080","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/1603","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/5163","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20163","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-0704","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2000/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2000/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/1838da7604055c8895f6f79e31255e78a27012a4/2000/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/7f8cb0f5372a51b89f819e1c3a9d694706e18788/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0704.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/59bd6fda35498288097a4f1fd0cdf8c04a1d74bd/CVE-2000/CVE-2000-07xx/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0704.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2000/0xxx/CVE-2000-0704.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2000/AVE-2000-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2000-0552","file_name":"2000/AVE-2000-0552.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2000-0703","title":"Perl suidperl 邮件 shell 转义序列本地权限提升漏洞","description":"suidperl（又称 sperl）是 Perl 5.00503 中用于执行 setuid 脚本的辅助程序，其在调用 /bin/mail 发送错误报告时未能正确过滤文件名中的 \"~!\" 转义序列。本地攻击者可通过设置 \"interactive\" 环境变量并构造包含该转义序列的特制文件名调用 suidperl，从而触发 mail 命令的 shell 转义，以提升至 root 权限。该漏洞影响 Perl 5.00503 及之前版本，攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，无需身份认证即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2000-0703"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"2000-10-20T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:52:18Z","remediation":"升级 Perl 至 5.6.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复 suidperl 对转义序列的过滤缺陷。如无法升级，可移除 suidperl 的 setuid 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/suidperl）或直接删除该二进制文件。各发行版用户请安装对应安全补丁：RedHat RHSA-2000-048、Caldera CSSA-2000-026、SUSE 安全公告第 59 号。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2000-08/0022.html","http://ar